abstract: >
  A reproducible and extensible framework for customer churn prediction
  research across heterogeneous e-commerce ecosystems. Includes standardized
  feature engineering, multiple evaluation metrics, SHAP explainability,
  calibration analysis, and cross-dataset comparison tools.
